# Week 01 – Git & GitHub

## Objective

Learn basic Git and GitHub concepts.

## Tasks

- [ ] Install Git.
- [ ] Check Git version.
- [ ] Create GitHub repository.
- [ ] Clone repository.
- [ ] Create README.md.
- [ ] Add files.
- [ ] Make commits.
- [ ] Push changes.
- [ ] Create branch.
- [ ] Merge branch.

## Commands

git init
git status
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
git push
git pull
git branch
git switch
git merge

## Deliverable

Working GitHub repository with commits and branches.
